  "name": "Headshot Damage Redirection",
  "slug": "headshot-damage-redirection",
  "teaser": "Survive headshots by redirecting damage to other body parts. Fully configurable split ratios, thresholds, and RNG options. Stop getting one-tapped and fight back! Compatible with SPT 4.0.7 & FIKA",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/lfdT5biRpfFEWJ1QNvOzJmh8lmQ2Z3002Z4JgAdR.png",
  "downloads": 8437,
  "favourites_count": 22,
  "description": "<p><em>Credit to Solarint for the original mod and Somtam for enhancements. I’ve updated it for SPT 4.0.7 and verified it works great!</em></p>\n<h2>What does it do?</h2>\n<p>Tired of getting instantly killed by headshots? This mod splits incoming head/chest damage between multiple body parts, giving you a chance to survive and fight back.</p>\n<p><strong>Default behavior (60% redirect):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Take a 100 damage headshot</li>\n<li>Head takes: 40 damage</li>\n<li>Other body parts: 60 damage (split)</li>\n<li>You survive to tell the tale!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\n<p><strong>Fully Configurable</strong> - Adjust redirect percentage, damage thresholds, body part targets\n<strong>Chest Protection</strong> - Optional chest damage redirection\n<strong>Smart Thresholds</strong> - Ignore low-damage hits, cap maximum damage\n<strong>RNG Mode</strong> - Add chance-based redirection for unpredictability\n<strong>In-Game Feedback</strong> - See exactly how damage was redirected\n<strong>Dad Gamer Mode</strong> - Global damage reduction slider for casual play</p>\n<h2>Configuration (F12 in-game)</h2>\n<p>All settings accessible via BepInEx Configuration Manager:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Redirect percentage (0-100%)</li>\n<li>Minimum damage threshold</li>\n<li>Maximum damage cap</li>\n<li>Chance to activate</li>\n<li>Body part selection</li>\n<li>And more!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Issues?</h2>\n<p>Report them here <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/perfk/Solarint-HeadshotDamageRedirect/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/perfk/Solarint-HeadshotDamageRedirect/issues</a> and will do my best to help</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Download zip</li>\n<li>Extract in your SPT folder</li>\n<li>Launch game</li>\n<li>Press F12 to configure settings</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Compatibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SPT 4.0.7</li>\n<li>FIKA Compatible - Tested with friends and seem to work fine</li>\n<li>Tested with SAIN and appears to work fine</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Credits</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Original</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Solarint/Solarint-HeadshotDamageRedirect\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Solarint</a></li>\n<li><strong>Updated by</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/gitTerebi/Solarint-HeadshotDamageRedirect\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Somtam</a></li>\n<li><strong>Updated for 4.0.7</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/perfk/Solarint-HeadshotDamageRedirect\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Perfk</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>If either Solarint or Somtam updates their mod then will i of course take this down</p>\n",
